      "description": "Aryl amine / N-aryl heterocycle ← electron-poor aryl fluoride + amine (SNAr)",
      "difficulty": 0.2,
      "n_precursors": 2,
      "notes": "Works best on electron-poor arenes (pyridines, nitro-aryls). Typically no metal catalyst needed. K2CO3 or Cs2CO3 base, DMSO solvent.",
